---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="Outwrite">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero outwrite">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work white">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">OUTWRITE</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">UI/UX</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">COPYWRITING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ILLUSTRATION</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ICONOGRAPHY</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>The smartest word-editing tool on the market.<br><br>Unlike other word-editing tools, Outwrite suggests more powerful alternatives for entire sentences. It also promotes more creativity in its suggestions and can be embedded into any writing platform, improving your writing anywhere you write.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/outwrite-mark_1outwrite-mark.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/outwrite-mark_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/outwrite-mark_1-p-800.png 800w, /images/outwrite-mark_1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/outwrite-mark_1outwrite-mark.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/WRITE-BETTER-RIGHT-AWAY-V3.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/outwrite-v3.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/outwrite-writer.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4e46d753-55c9-db65-bd2c-6db41309ac57-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/outwrite-icons_1outwrite-icons.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/outwrite-icons_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/outwrite-icons_1-p-800.png 800w, /images/outwrite-icons_1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/outwrite-icons_1outwrite-icons.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/outwrite-social.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>We chose traditional proofreading marks in our design to show that Outwrite&#x27;s smart technology notices every tiny detail, down to every accent.<br><br>Outwrite is smarter, more detailed, more creative, more intuitive, more versatile and more modern than its competitors, welcoming writing into the 21st century.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4de8a0e5-ab81-d579-9dee-b09df83eaf5c-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/outwrite-rewrite.mp4" img="/images/work-2.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-2-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-2-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-2-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-2.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/Outwrite-desktop.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36b9-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/outwrite-high.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/outwrite-high-p-500.png 500w, /images/outwrite-high-p-800.png 800w, /images/outwrite-high-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/outwrite-high.webp 1441w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_2b94b5c1-a98c-7ca1-8bd9-b8cad26c8702-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/outwrite-write.mp4" img="/images/work-2.webp" size="small" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-2-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-2-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-2-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-2.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-c919498d-959b-1740-bc47-c06d766d59dd-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell">
          <blockquote class="block-quote">They are truly invested in our success. This makes for great friendships, great collaboration and stunning results.<br></blockquote>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-d8eb221c-a148-e54a-a635-26d3812e4d08-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/outwrite-improve.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/outwrite-improve-p-500.png 500w, /images/outwrite-improve-p-800.png 800w, /images/outwrite-improve-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/outwrite-improve.webp 1441w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-dd405f37-8b15-2a10-72c9-f5d0676ea659-f4473ed1" class="w-layout-cell cell-3"><img src="/images/outwrite-stats_1outwrite-stats.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/outwrite-stats_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/outwrite-stats_1-p-800.png 800w, /images/outwrite-stats_1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/outwrite-stats_1outwrite-stats.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
